<div>
    <h2>About Joel</h2>
    <p>
        Joel Hilton is a passionate film enthusiast who minored in Film Studies at BYU and has built an impressive personal movie collection over the years. He carefully curates his collection, only adding films he believes are truly worthy. In addition to his love for movies, Joel performs regularly with Quick Wits Comedy and contracts as a movie reviewer for ClearPlay. He also co-hosts the weekly podcast Baconsale, where he discusses films and pop culture with humor and insight.
    </p>
